# Local config: CuteAFD v5.0.0 (tag d8e566e8), 2x RTX PRO 6000, local experts, no Sparks. K4-Core-K6-HQA (wrldsuksgo2mars e0ecc3d5): K4 experts, native K6 core and head, plus BF16 copies of MLA q_b_proj and every o_proj. ATTENTION_MODE is not set here, so the launch default (hqa) applies; the other two views of the same checkpoint are chosen per launch with --set ATTENTION_MODE=compact (the parent K6 projections) or --set ATTENTION_MODE=fp8-compact (FP8 converted at load; upstream #1751: W8A8 at prefill on Flash).
# Ported from the v4.0.0 file in <stacks>/cuteafd-v4/local (local settings kept: ADDR on 127.0.0.1,
# USAGE=off, MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS at the engine ceiling, image pinned by digest, drafter pinned).
# Changes from v4.0.0: COORDINATOR_GPU=0 -> COORDINATOR_GPUS=0,1 (the old key is an unknown key on v5: hard error);
# MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=0 (v5 has no fixed ceiling; <=0 means bounded only by the context left after the prompt);
# INSTANCE=local-v5 (own launcher state and container name); v5 image. Loop abort is new in v5 and left at its
# default (on): a reply it ends reports finish_reason=length with usage.finish_detail="repetition".
#
#   cd <stacks>/cuteafd-v5 && HF_HOME=<hf-home> ./run.sh --config local/glm53-flash-exl3-k4-core-k6-hqa-2rtx.config --dry-run
